    "OT_VERSE_LINE": "Job 1:21 — “Naked I came from my mother’s womb, and naked shall I return.”",
    "NT_VERSE_LINE": "Hebrews 4:13 — “All things are naked and open to the eyes of Him to whom we must give account.”",
    "GREEK": "γυμνός",
